contentText:
Maluma is gearing up for the release of his seventh studio album, Loco x Volver , dropping May 15.

Loosely translated to &#8220;dying to return,” the album will be home to 14 songs, including four previously released tracks: “1+1” with Kany García, “Botero” with Arcángel and NTG, “Con el Corazón” with the late Regional Colombian singer Yeison Jimenez, and the Ryan Castro-assisted “Pa’ La Seca.” The former of the four hit No. 1 on the Billboard Tropical Airplay and Latin Airplay charts this week.

